    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p6-q5-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\log_x81=2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=9$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^2&=81\\\\x^2&=9^2\\\\x&=9\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe logarithm base requires $x>0$, so the negative root is excluded.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
      },
      {
        "id": "p6-q5-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\log_x8=6$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\sqrt{2}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^6&=8\\\\x^6&=2^3\\\\x&=2^{3/6}\\\\x&=\\sqrt{2}\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe logarithm base requires $x>0$, so the negative root is excluded.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 34
      },
      {
